Upstream source: tag v4.0.1, commit d262ab3882952a59312ff3537cd86d894523c5ab.

Statement of changes (Apache License 2.0, section 4b). Upstream targets Claude
Code and ships a statusline, a `SessionStart` handler, a mode-tracker hook and a
stats hook that read Claude's JSONL transcripts. That plumbing does not exist in
Hermes, so this port replaces it and leaves the skill text itself intact:

  ADDED (new work, not from upstream)
    bin/caveman                     mode state, CLI and stats reader
    agent-hooks/caveman-mode-guard.py   pre_llm_call: activate + enforce mode
    agent-hooks/caveman-ledger.py       post_api_request: per-call usage ledger
    scripts/configure-hooks.py      install/uninstall wiring for config.yaml
    install.sh, uninstall.sh, tests/verify.sh, docs/

  MODIFIED (skill text, marked in-file with a "Hermes port" notice)
    skills/caveman/SKILL.md          persistence section: Hermes mode state
    skills/caveman/README.md         Hermes stack table
    skills/caveman-help/SKILL.md     Hermes commands, default-mode resolution
    skills/caveman-stats/SKILL.md    rewritten: native stats instead of Claude I/O
    skills/caveman-stats/README.md   rewritten: native stats instead of Claude I/O
    skills/ultracave/SKILL.md        persistence line: Hermes mode state
    skills/megacave/SKILL.md         persistence line: Hermes mode state

  UNCHANGED (verbatim from upstream v4.0.1)
    skills/caveman-commit/, skills/caveman-review/, skills/caveman-compress/

The Apache License text is in LICENSE. No upstream NOTICE content is reproduced
here because the files shipped in this repository are the skills only; the Go
engine, browser bridge, CLI package and fonts listed in upstream's NOTICE are
not part of this distribution.
